are in sync.\n45: exit=0\n46: [dsh-prompt-sync] PASS: 45 prompt stubs are in sync.\n47: exit=0\n48: $ ASY\n49: [codex-agent-sync] PASS: 11 agents are in sync.\n50: exit=0\n51: [pi-agent-sync] PASS: 11 agents are in sync.\n52: exit=0\n53: [dsh-agent-sync] PASS: 11 agent patches are in sync.\n54: exit=0\n55: $ AMSC\n56: agent-mirror-sync: 11 agent(s) checked — all comparable mirrors in sync — OK\n57: exit=0\n58: $ AMC\n59: STATUS=OK rows=12 findings=0 unknown=0\n60: exit=0\n61: $ MAN\n62: [agents-md-manifest] PASS: 44 sections, 31 pins, derived matches AGENTS.md\n63: [agents-md-manifest] Budget: 16092 / 16384 bytes to the last anchor, 27575 / 32768 bytes total, 21 history bodies\n64: exit=0\n65: $ GPC\n66: [gate1-pointer-sync] PASS: 1 instruction files carry the root Gate 1 and Gate 2 pointers.\n67: exit=0\n68: $ RCC\n69: OK: all rule invariants present (8 exact-string file(s) + 2 Iron Law file(s) + 21 delivery-prefix anchor(s) + 6 extension floor(s) + 2 example output(s)).\n70: exit=0\n71: $ CRS\n72: all 7 hubs resolve\n73: all 55 served copies match their authored files\n74: exit=0\n75: $ PSC\n76: OK: parent-skill-check — all hard invariants passed, 0 warnings\n77: exit=0\n78: $ CCM\n79: STATUS=OK command-catalog-mirror: every catalog and hub metadata covers the command tree\n80: exit=0\n81: $ RV\n82: OK: route-validate — 32 routes validated, 11 warnings\n83: exit=0\n84: $ DPR\n85: STATUS=OK phrases=248 bridges=36\n86: exit=0\n87: $ OLD | wc -l\n88:       55\n89: $ node MBC --help | head -1\n90: measure-brief-cost.mjs: unknown option: --help\n91: $ BASE doctor rows offered\n92: false\n93: false","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/016-claude-create-reach-and-doctor-default/scratch/before.txt, lines 1-93\n1: $ git rev-parse --short HEAD\n2: 087888ec4a\n3: $