iants present (8 exact-string file(s) + 2 Iron Law file(s) + 21 delivery-prefix anchor(s) + 6 extension floor(s) + 2 example output(s)).\n70: exit=0\n71: $ CRS\n72: all 7 hubs resolve\n73: all 55 served copies match their authored files\n74: exit=0\n75: $ PSC\n76: OK: parent-skill-check — all hard invariants passed, 0 warnings\n77: exit=0\n78: $ CCM\n79: STATUS=OK command-catalog-mirror: every catalog and hub metadata covers the command tree\n80: exit=0\n81: $ RV\n82: OK: route-validate — 32 routes validated, 11 warnings\n83: exit=0\n84: $ DPR\n85: STATUS=OK phrases=248 bridges=36\n86: exit=0\n87: $ OLD | wc -l\n88:       55\n89: $ node MBC --help | head -1\n90: measure-brief-cost.mjs: unknown option: --help\n91: $ BASE doctor rows offered\n92: false\n93: false"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/016-claude-create-reach-and-doctor-default/scratch/before.txt\"}"},"time":{"start":1794582790360,"end":1794582791032}}}}
